      "privatePressure": "提供最快军驿可能帮助真相，也可能把前线卷入政治风暴。",
      "keyLeverage": "提供军驿主路、备用路线和军情压力证明",
      "defaultPrepare": "准备军驿和军情说明",
      "defaultCommit": "把有效材料按时送达，不为政治意见改写内容",
      "dialogueSeeds": [
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n7.zhejiang_governor.01",
          "text": "“军驿可以给最快的路，但我不替任何供状增删一句。”",
          "purpose": "PROBE_OR_FRAME",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.final_testimonies",
            "obj.final_dispatch_routes"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n7.zhejiang_governor.02",
          "text": "“前线吃紧要写进收件说明，不能拿军情去压掉证词本身。”",
          "purpose": "BARGAIN_OR_THREAT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.final_testimonies",
            "obj.final_dispatch_routes"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n7.zhejiang_governor.03",
          "text": "“两路材料若要并行，先确认各自封印前已经合法存在。”",
          "purpose": "HANDOFF_OR_COMMITMENT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.final_testimonies",
            "obj.final_dispatch_routes"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "privateOpening": "胡宗宪仍能提供军驿和军情说明，不能替任何供状增删内容。案上材料由上一阶段实际存续与送达结果决定。",
